\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S15}{\ignorespaces Pipeline parameter values and Kalman initialisation details. All parameters are fixed across experiments and cell lines; none require user tuning. $P(x,0)$ initialisation: initial uncertainty is estimated as $P(x,0) = \max (R_\text  {base}(0),\, 1.0)$, where $R_\text  {base}(0) = \operatorname  {Var}_x(u_\text  {RANSAC}(x,0) - u_\text  {det}(x,0))$ is the within-frame spatial residual variance between RANSAC-rejected and Savitzky--Golay smoothed edges at $t = 0$. Fallback: if fewer than 6 finite-valued columns are available or fallback detection is active at $t = 0$, $R_\text  {base}(0) = 0.1 \times Q_0 = 40$~px$^2$. The floor of 1.0 prevents zero initial uncertainty from collapsing the Kalman gain. Numerical safeguards: (i) non-finite $R$ clamped to $Q_0$; (ii) non-finite Kalman output reset to previous edge; (iii) $P$ reset to $P^-$ when hard safety net fires; (iv) last-resort revert if $A(t) > A(t-1)$ persists after all constraint paths.}}{26}{table.caption.39}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:pipeline-parameters}{{S15}{26}{Pipeline parameter values and Kalman initialisation details. All parameters are fixed across experiments and cell lines; none require user tuning. $P(x,0)$ initialisation: initial uncertainty is estimated as $P(x,0) = \max (R_\text {base}(0),\, 1.0)$, where $R_\text {base}(0) = \operatorname {Var}_x(u_\text {RANSAC}(x,0) - u_\text {det}(x,0))$ is the within-frame spatial residual variance between RANSAC-rejected and Savitzky--Golay smoothed edges at $t = 0$. Fallback: if fewer than 6 finite-valued columns are available or fallback detection is active at $t = 0$, $R_\text {base}(0) = 0.1 \times Q_0 = 40$~px$^2$. The floor of 1.0 prevents zero initial uncertainty from collapsing the Kalman gain. Numerical safeguards: (i) non-finite $R$ clamped to $Q_0$; (ii) non-finite Kalman output reset to previous edge; (iii) $P$ reset to $P^-$ when hard safety net fires; (iv) last-resort revert if $A(t) > A(t-1)$ persists after all constraint paths}{table.caption.39}{}}
\gdef \@abspage@last{26}
